      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/nothanksfrankie/status/1962940143620247772",
      "text": "Becoming more concerned about who is behind the clearly coordinated efforts by multiple (at least 15-20) accounts on here that, while supporting efforts to call out China's illegal activities in the WPS and western Pacific, are flooding my (and probably your) \"For You Feed\" with what amounts to inauthentic activity. I am seeing more of these inauthentic accounts now daily than I am seeing genuine accounts. Please don't follow them and don't repost them- even if you're tagged. These accounts are not likely linked back to the Philippines or the US and they are beginning to monopolize the narrative in ways that are not always constructive to what we're hoping to achieve. Thank you for your attention to this matter.\n -Frankie",
